### SECTION 2: Quote Section (with parallax scroll animations)

A full-viewport (`h-screen`) section with:

**Background**: CSS linear-gradient top to bottom:
```
#010A17 0% -> #0A4267 30% -> #20658E 60% -> #6BADC4 100%
